Notes on the data:
  - All data is computed from production Lucid platform logs (Spanner database).
  - All user identifiers are hashed; no personally identifying information
    (email, phone, name) is present.
  - The 4 embedded AI-attitude items in the 74-question spectrum are released
    as aggregate response distributions only — item-level text is held private
    to preserve future-cohort comparability.
  - Dates are preserved at day-level granularity.
  - This is preliminary data accompanying a manuscript in preparation; future
    revisions may extend Phase 2 (intervention) and Phase 3 (cross-product
    bridge) data. Dataset versioning follows semantic versioning (current v0.1).
